<h1 style='color: #111827; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 16px 0; line-height: 1.3; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;'>
    Reset your password
</h1>

<p style='color: #6b7280; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 24px 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;'>
    We received a request to reset the password for your account. If this was you, click the button below to create a
    new password.
</p>

{{> button link=link buttonText="Reset my password"}}

<div style='background-color: #fef9c3; border-left: 3px solid #fbbf24; padding: 12px 16px; border-radius: 4px; margin-bottom: 24px;'>
    <p style='color: #78350f; font-size: 14px; margin: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;'>
        This link will expire in <strong>{{ minutes }} minutes</strong>. If you didn't request a password reset, you can
        safely ignore this email - your account will remain secure.
    </p>
</div>

{{> divider}}

<p style='color: #9ca3af; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;'>
    If you're having trouble clicking the button, copy and paste the link below into your browser.
</p>
<p style='color: #9ca3af; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 8px 0 0; word-break: break-all; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;'>
    {{ link }}
</p>
